0 FILE 10218 - Brown House 2 Downstairs.ldr
0 Ground floor of the brown house: large floor plates, hinged plates, white and reddish-brown panel and brick walls with log detailing, headlight bricks, glazed windows and a panelled door, finished with slopes, tiles and a technic rotor
